  "boundary": "This plan establishes a fail-closed physical-device qualification control for the retained V1.7.1 exact-source matrix. A real record may contribute only the device evidence group for one eligible lane after separate governed review. Form-factor records do not replace rendered evidence; Touch and Native behavior still require Human evidence; Energy behavior still requires independent Energy evidence. Browser CI, emulators, simulators, templates, protocol self-tests, and one device represented as an entire platform or form-factor matrix are not physical-device acceptance. No Section 48, V1.7.1 lifecycle, consumer, deployment, publication, or production authority is granted automatically."
